{
  "schema": "portal2-scenarios/v1",
  "description": "sp_a2_laser_intro played through and solved with the player's own input (A* over a grid measured in the running game; keys, turn rates and both portal-gun buttons through the console) and screenshotted at each story beat: this build plays the relit map sp_a2_laser_intro_relit (published by the map pipeline, gameplay lumps byte-identical), retail Portal 2 the shipped sp_a2_laser_intro. Run by tools/quality/portal2_storybeats.py.",
